          "expr": "sum(rate(cowatcher_qa_cache_hit_total[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(cowatcher_qa_cache_hit_total[5m])) + sum(rate(cowatcher_qa_cache_miss_total[5m])), 1e-9)",
